<title>USA: UBS N.Y. names Patrick Dimick VP, gov't strategist.</title>
<headline>UBS N.Y. names Patrick Dimick VP, gov't strategist.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities LLC has named Patrick Dimick vice president and government bond strategist, the firm announced Friday.</p>
<p>Dimick joins UBS from CS First Boston Corp, where he had been a Treasury market analyst since 1994.</p>
<p>Prior to that, Dimick had worked in economic forecasting and consulting at DRI/McGraw Hill.</p>
<p>-- Steven Scheer, N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1867</p>
</text>
